         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Writing the Quotient\n\nIn this exercise you write the quotient yourself, digit by digit. Look at the number being divided, check the times table below and type the digit in the highlighted box.\n\nWhen the digit is right, the app performs the multiplication and the subtraction of that step and moves to the next box. If the digit does not fit, the product appears under the division so you can compare it and try again.\n\nAt the end you receive a medal, and the **New division** button starts another division.",
